<div class="flashlights-players">
  <p>Choose which connected players have a flashlight. Changes are saved automatically.</p>
  <p>Players without a flashlight can still see the areas illuminated by their teammates. New players have a flashlight by default. Choices are remembered after reconnecting.</p>
  <button type="button" data-action="refreshPlayers"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Refresh player list</button>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Connected player</th><th>Has a flashlight</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {{#each players}}
      <tr>
        <td><label for="flashlights-player-{{id}}">{{name}}</label></td>
        <td><input id="flashlights-player-{{id}}" name="player.{{id}}" data-user-id="{{id}}" type="checkbox" {{#if enabled}}checked{{/if}}></td>
      </tr>
      {{else}}
      <tr><td colspan="2">No players are connected.</td></tr>
      {{/each}}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="hint">The list updates when players connect or disconnect. The GM flashlight is controlled separately by Share the GM flashlight.</p>
</div>
